      "writtenOn": "2023-11-09T01:30:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is actually a nit, but I mean:\n\n     void poweredOnMode(bool on);\n\nThis way, neither \u0027poweredOnMode(true)\u0027 nor \u0027poweredOnMode(false)\u0027 is a double negative.\n\nWhat does \u0027Powered Off Mode\u0027 do anyway? If it\u0027s a feature, what does it do? The name change might not make sense, depending on what the feature does.",
      "parentUuid": "839cfd3b_f684121f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 34,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 34,
        "endChar": 26
