      "writtenOn": "2023-11-09T07:09:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The feature is \"powered off finding\". I.e., the Android device is findable also when powered off. Therefore, poweredOnMode won\u0027t make sense. Here \"off\" is not a negative word, but part of the phrase \"powered off\".",
      "parentUuid": "384c54cd_8fa409c0",
